thumbnail\" height=\"230\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frost_Manor_6_6d697d.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Core</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Guildhall</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">434 sqm</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"beds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max. Beds</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">26</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rent\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rent</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500,000 gp per month<br/>(1,152 gp per sqm)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Location</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Svargrond</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"street\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Street</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Wilderness</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"openwindows\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Windows</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">21</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">24</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Beer%20Cask\">Beer Cask</a>, 3 Blackboards, 3x9 Brown Carpet, 3 Dustbins, Locker, 8sqm Table, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine%20Cask\">Wine Cask</a>\n32 <a href=\"#/wiki/Wall%20Lamp\">Wall Lamps</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Mailbox\">Mailbox</a> just outside the main door.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145733&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_5_d2c888.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32287,31106,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32287, 31106, 5)</a></div>\n<p>In a cliff in a northeastern part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"tw-cmd\" data-command=\"get-house-url\" data-houseid=\"55303\" data-housetype=\"guildhalls\"></div></dd></dl>\n<p>This guildhall is made of ice and has 3 towers decorated with <a href=\"#/wiki/Tusk\">tusks</a> at the top.<br/>It is accessible 2 floors up north of town following the cliffs around to the right. There are <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Polar%20Bear\">Polar Bears</a> in this area too. From the 24 distinct room areas, there are 11 bed rooms, 5 room balconies and 4 roof areas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-house-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before April 15, 2019, this house's rent was 26370 gold per month.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Wilderness_Buildings\">Related Wilderness Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%27s%20Outpost\">Adventurer's Outpost</a></li><li>Bloodhall</li><li>Caveman Shelter</li><li>Demon Tower</li><li>Eastern House of Tranquility</li><li>Halls of the Adventurers</li><li>Hill Hideout</li><li>House of Recreation</li><li>Lost Cavern</li><li>Low Waters Observatory</li><li>Meriana Beach</li><li>Moonkeep</li><li>Mountain Hideout</li><li>Nautic Observer</li><li>Nordic Stronghold</li><li>Old Sanctuary of God King Qjell</li><li>Shadow Towers</li><li>Snake Tower</li><li>Spiritkeep</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Suntower%20%28Blessing%29\">Suntower (Blessing)</a></li><li>The Hideout</li><li>The Lair</li><li>The Treehouse</li><li>The Yeah Beach Project</li><li>Venore Poorhouse</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["thawing-mini-world-change"]}